<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Table 1: </span><span id="S4.T2.fig1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Benchmark Captions Through Text-to-Image Reconstructions.</span> We evaluate the captions through FID scores (<math id="S4.T2.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math>), with image recontruction. We use Stable Diffusion 3.5 Medium to reconstruct images with captions. Best results with open-source models are <span id="S4.T2.fig1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bolded</span>; <sup id="S4.T2.fig1.12" class="ltx_sup">∗</sup>: best for all.</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
